The '''Dwarven Sack''' is an {{Epic}} [[Sacks|Sack]] that holds materials found in the {{zone|Dwarven Mines}}. This sack can be bought from {{NPCSprite|Elizabeth}} in the [[Community Center]] for {{Bits|14k}}.

== Obtaining ==
=== Shop Purchase ===
The '''Dwarven Sack''' can be purchased from {{NPCSprite|Elizabeth}} in the [[Community Center]] for {{Bits|14k}}.

== Usage ==
The '''Dwarven Sack''' can store items obtained in the {{Zone|Dwarven Mines}}.
